      "description": "Compare metrics between two date ranges side by side. Ideal for before/after deploy analysis. period_a is the baseline and period_b is measured against it: deltas are period_b minus period_a, and percent is relative to period_a. To compare a period with the one of the same length right before it, such as this week with last week, pass only period_b ("7d").",
